## FFmpeg executable

FFmpeg is a separate executable launched by DubLine. Its license depends on
the actual build and enabled libraries; it is not licensed under the DubLine
Source License. The Windows binary currently downloaded by ffmpeg-static
comes from its b6.1.1 release. The supplied binary README identifies it as
6.1.1-essentials_build-www.gyan.dev, under GPL v3, with source revision
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/e38092ef93.

The packaging hook copies ffmpeg.exe.LICENSE and ffmpeg.exe.README from the
installed ffmpeg-static package to resources/licenses/third-party/ffmpeg/.
These identify the actual binary license and build details. The Node wrapper
has its own GPL-3.0-or-later license in the npm notices; do not confuse that
license with the executable's licensing or with Electron's ffmpeg.dll.

Anyone distributing FFmpeg must satisfy the applicable GPL obligations,
including providing the complete corresponding source for the exact binary,
its included libraries, and build scripts by a method permitted by GPL v3.
The upstream source link and these notices alone do not satisfy all of those
obligations. Preserve the binary's build information and arrange the required
source provision when publishing a distribution.

Upstream: https://ffmpeg.org/
License guidance: https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html
Binary release: https://github.com/eugeneware/ffmpeg-static/releases/tag/b6.1.1
Windows build provider: https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/

## Cloudflared executable

Cloudflared is the separate Cloudflare tunnel helper. DubLine's downloader
pins version 2026.9.3 and verifies the binary's SHA-256. Cloudflared is under
Apache-2.0; its dependencies retain their own licenses. The upstream LICENSE
from that tag is retained in resources/licenses/cloudflared/LICENSE and copied
to resources/licenses/third-party/cloudflared/ in the packaged application.
The provenance file records the source tag. Preserve applicable notices for
Cloudflared's embedded dependencies when redistributing or replacing it.

Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared
Pinned license: https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/blob/2026.9.3/LICENSE

